Subject: [PATCH 1/2] rename: DivaModManager X with cyan X accent
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Window titles: 'DivaModManager X' (main), 'GameBanana Mod Browser — DivaModManager X', 'DivaModArchive Browser — DivaModManager X'
- Main window header: two Run elements — 'DivaModManager ' (Miku teal #39C5BB) + 'X' (cyan #22D3EE, ExtraBold)
- Startup log message updated
- README heading updated
- xbps template short_desc updated
- .desktop file Name + StartupWMClass updated

Cosmetic only — no behavior change.
